WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,900
The person least qualified to say that Qing Shui is cold-blooded is you, right?

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:10,060
When Li Wei'an and I were in front of you, we were about to be torn apart by those lunatics.

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:14,160
It was Qing Shui who saved him and me, and you, An Xiaolin, were watching from the side

4
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:17,860
Qing Shui may be cold-blooded, but he saved us, I don’t know how many lives he lost.

5
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:25,320
I'm sorry, I just don't want to die. Just put those words back.

6
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,140
Things fulfill their responsibilities, and everyone survives

7
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:32,640
If you continue to do this, you don’t need anyone to abandon you, you will abandon yourself.

8
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:39,895
Li

9
00:00:39,895 --> 00:00:41,406
Sister Li

10
00:00:41,406 --> 00:00:42,916
Brother Li

11
00:00:42,916 --> 00:00:45,182
Brother Li

12
00:00:45,182 --> 00:00:46,693
dead

13
00:00:46,693 --> 00:00:51,980
Killed by that woman

14
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:59,050
It’s interesting. Come on, take a look and see how that woman moves.
